# CodeMate

CodeMate is an AI-powered terminal coding agent built from scratch in Python.

It can understand a coding task, decide which tool to use, execute that tool, observe the result, and continue until the task is completed.

The project focuses on understanding the core architecture behind modern AI coding agents rather than hiding the orchestration behind an agent framework.

---

## Features

- AI-powered coding agent
- Multi-step agent loop
- File listing
- File reading
- File writing
- Terminal command execution
- Git status inspection
- Git diff inspection
- Workspace sandbox
- Basic command safety checks
- Unknown-tool protection
- Agent step limits
- Command timeout
- Command output limits
- FastAPI REST API
- API key authentication
- Request validation
- Request logging
- Local Ollama + Qwen Coder integration

---

## Architecture

```text
User
 │
 ▼
Terminal / FastAPI
 │
 ▼
CodeMate Agent
 │
 ├── LLM
 │    └── Ollama + Qwen 2.5 Coder
 │
 ├── Executor
 │
 └── Tools
      ├── list_files
      ├── read_file
      ├── write_file
      ├── run_command
      ├── git_status
      └── git_diff
 │
 ▼
Workspace